===Etymology===
{{etyl|goh|de}} ''[[heriberga]]'', compound of ''[[Heer]]'' and a derivation of ''[[bergen]]'', literally "accomodation for the army". Related to ''[[harbour]]'' and ''[[harbinger]]''.

